#usda 1.0
(
    "USD Museum exhibit composition.errors.cycles: diamonds and cycles. A diamond composes its shared layer once; a cycling arc contributes nothing and the rest composes. Every ghost and slot filled; the red outlines stay empty. Built by src/build.py."
